Negative control for the acting-for matrix reaching the page (`R6-31`).

Reads the scope matrix off the BOOTED CELL's context again instead of off the
composable the declaration named. Only `useAuth` ever published that member, so
for every other module the read is `undefined`, nothing registers, and the scope
bar's acting-for segment silently never renders — the live defect this replaced.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Reds: the port spec — a port booted from a scoped composable publishes that
composable's own matrix.

diff --git a/playgrounds/labs-nuxt/modules/scenarios/runtime/composables/useModulePort.ts b/playgrounds/labs-nuxt/modules/scenarios/runtime/composables/useModulePort.ts
